track sig vel=0.38 len=0.5 patch=glasslead reverb_send=0.4 echo_send=0.2 pan=-0.35
>READ R:7 A4:0.25@0.4 D4:1.25@0.36
automate sig.mono
1
automate sig.glide
0.2
automate sig.attack
